Package: greeterkind
Type: Package
Title: The Greeter Kinds, Declared for R
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("jose-pr", email = "jose-pr@coqui.dev", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: The kinds of the greeter_kind C header (a greeter, a counter,
    a conversation and its listener), declared for R: a host calls a greeter
    through them, and a greeter written in R implements them.
License: MPL-2.0
Depends: R (>= 4.2)
Imports: methods, guatiao
Encoding: UTF-8
